00:07:15.007 --> 00:07:20.509
In Tibetan society, to become a monk or a
nun is regarded as the highest vocation

00:07:21.169 --> 00:07:21.869
and also the

00:07:21.869 --> 00:07:23.630
highest service to the community.

00:07:35.844 --> 00:07:40.568
