a public audience and a blessing.

00:07:41.829 --> 00:07:46.372
The Dalai Lama was recognized at the age
of two as the reincarnate spiritual and

00:07:46.472 --> 00:07:48.113
temporal leader of his people.

00:07:49.054 --> 00:07:53.737
Until the age of 25, he received the
classical education of a Buddhist monk in

00:07:53.738 --> 00:07:55.118
an isolationist Tibet.

00:07:56.159 --> 00:08:00.903
Since coming into exile, he has pursued
his studies uninterruptedly and is now

00:08:00.983 --> 00:08:02.324
recognized internationally.

00:08:02.804 --> 00:08:04.985
